#: src/features/roadmap/CreateBoardDialog.tsx
msgid "This inbox has no web chat channel. Add one first, because the public board embeds it."
msgstr "此收件匣沒有網頁聊天管道。請先新增一個，因為公開看板會嵌入它。"

